1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:10,008
Bugungi videomiz qanday? Yaponiyaning qishloq hayoti haqida.

2
00:00:10,008 --> 00:00:11,508
Sahna 1: Koʻchib kelganidan keyin tanishuv / Koʻchib kelgandan keyingi taqdimot

3
00:00:11,508 --> 00:00:13,041
Salom.

4
00:00:13,064 --> 00:00:16,064
Salom, assalomu alaykum.

5
00:00:16,087 --> 00:00:19,353
Koʻchib kelganimiz munosabati bilan salom berishga keldim.

6
00:00:19,376 --> 00:00:22,413
Ah, rahmat.

7
00:00:22,437 --> 00:00:27,124
Men kecha qoʻshni eski uyga koʻchib keldim.

8
00:00:27,148 --> 00:00:29,215
Shundaymi?

9
00:00:29,238 --> 00:00:31,848
Ismingiz nima?

10
00:00:31,871 --> 00:00:34,004
Mayk.

11
00:00:34,027 --> 00:00:36,481
Amerikadan kelganman.

12
00:00:36,504 --> 00:00:38,675
Mayk desangiz.

13
00:00:38,698 --> 00:00:41,735
Yapon tilini yaxshi gapirasiz-ku.

14
00:00:41,759 --> 00:00:46,400
Yoʻq, hali yaxshi emas.

15
00:00:46,424 --> 00:00:50,499
Amerikaning qayeridan kelgansiz?

16
00:00:50,522 --> 00:00:52,997
Nyu-Yorkdan kelganman.

17
00:00:53,021 --> 00:00:54,892
Nyu-Yorkmi?

18
00:00:54,916 --> 00:00:57,649
Katta shahar ekan-ku.

19
00:00:57,672 --> 00:01:01,919
Ha, juda katta shahar.

20
00:01:01,943 --> 00:01:05,209
Nega bu qishloqqa keldingiz?

21
00:01:05,232 --> 00:01:09,365
Yaponiyaning tinch qishloqlarini yaxshi koʻraman.

22
00:01:09,388 --> 00:01:11,388
Shundaymi?

23
00:01:11,411 --> 00:01:13,978
Bu juda yaxshi.

24
00:01:14,001 --> 00:01:18,168
Bu uy juda keng va eski.

25
00:01:18,191 --> 00:01:22,067
Ha. 100 yil avval qurilgan.

26
00:01:22,090 --> 00:01:26,690
100 yil oldinmi? Ajoyib!

27
00:01:26,713 --> 00:01:29,646
Qishloq hayoti siz uchun yangi mi?

28
00:01:29,669 --> 00:01:33,079
Ha, yangi.

29
00:01:33,103 --> 00:01:36,437
Nyu-Yorkdagi uyingiz ham keng edi mi?

30
00:01:36,460 --> 00:01:41,660
Yoʻq, Nyu-Yorkdagi kvartiram tor edi.

31
00:01:41,684 --> 00:01:43,450
Shundaymi?

32
00:01:43,473 --> 00:01:46,887
Bu yerda xonalar koʻp.

33
00:01:46,911 --> 00:01:50,778
Ha, jami 8 xona bor.

34
00:01:50,801 --> 00:01:53,367
Yolgʻiz yashaysizmi?

35
00:01:53,390 --> 00:01:56,864
Ha, yolgʻiz.

36
00:01:56,887 --> 00:02:00,254
Oilangiz Amerikada mi?

37
00:02:00,277 --> 00:02:04,057
Ha, ota-onam va singlim bor.

38
00:02:04,080 --> 00:02:06,888
Qandaydir muammo bormi?

39
00:02:06,911 --> 00:02:10,968
Hali doʻkonlarni bilmayman.

40
00:02:10,991 --> 00:02:14,525
Yaqin atrofda kichik doʻkon bor.

41
00:02:14,548 --> 00:02:17,434
U soat nechada ochiladi?

42
00:02:17,457 --> 00:02:20,224
Ertalab soat 9 da ochiladi.

43
00:02:20,247 --> 00:02:23,299
Tushunarli. Borib koʻraman.

44
00:02:23,322 --> 00:02:26,211
U yerda non va sut bor.

45
00:02:26,234 --> 00:02:28,901
Bu yaxshi.

46
00:02:28,924 --> 00:02:30,390
Yordam berdingiz.

47
00:02:30,413 --> 00:02:33,013
Har qanday savolingiz boʻlsa, soʻrang.

48
00:02:33,036 --> 00:02:36,648
Ha, iltimos.

49
00:02:36,672 --> 00:02:45,681
Bugungi videoning skriptini tavsiflar va eng yaxshi izohdan yuklab olish mumkin. Yuklab olishdan oldin izoh qoldirishni unutmang.

50
00:02:45,681 --> 00:02:47,181
Sahna 2: Sabzavot sovgʻasi / Sabzavotlarni sovgʻa qilish va qabul qilish

51
00:02:47,181 --> 00:02:50,115
Mayk, salom.

52
00:02:50,138 --> 00:02:52,938
Salom. Qalaysiz?

53
00:02:52,961 --> 00:02:56,327
Ha, yaxshiman.

54
00:02:56,350 --> 00:02:59,484
Bogʻdan sabzavotlar terildi.

55
00:02:59,507 --> 00:03:02,576
Voy, qanchalik koʻp sabzavotlar!

56
00:03:02,599 --> 00:03:05,015
Bu sizga.

57
00:03:05,038 --> 00:03:07,056
Iltimos, yeying.

58
00:03:07,080 --> 00:03:10,748
Rostdanmi? Rahmat.

59
00:03:10,772 --> 00:03:14,138
Pomidor, bodring va baqlajonlar.

60
00:03:14,161 --> 00:03:16,764
Hammasi juda mazali koʻrinadi.

61
00:03:16,788 --> 00:03:20,435
Bugun ertalab bogʻdan terib oldim.

62
00:03:20,458 --> 00:03:23,309
Bu juda yangi sabzavotlar.

63
00:03:23,332 --> 00:03:27,402
Amerikada ham sabzavot yedingizmi?

64
00:03:27,425 --> 00:03:30,858
Ha, lekin doʻkondan sotib oldim.

65
00:03:30,881 --> 00:03:33,458
Oʻzingiz ekmaydizmi?

66
00:03:33,482 --> 00:03:37,938
Nyu-Yorkdagi uyimizda bogʻ yoʻq edi.

67
00:03:37,961 --> 00:03:39,894
Shundaymi?

68
00:03:39,917 --> 00:03:43,851
Qishloqda hamma bogʻ ekadi.

69
00:03:43,874 --> 00:03:46,567
Bu qiziqarli ekan.

70
00:03:46,590 --> 00:03:49,832
Mayk, siz ovqat pishirasizmi?

71
00:03:49,856 --> 00:03:53,022
Ha, baʼzida pishiraman.

72
00:03:53,045 --> 00:03:56,289
Pomidorni qanday yeyishni yaxshi koʻrasiz?

73
00:03:56,313 --> 00:03:58,313
Salat qilib yeyman.

74
00:03:58,336 --> 00:04:01,936
Bodringga tuz sepib yeying.

75
00:04:01,959 --> 00:04:05,226
Tuzmi? Sinab koʻrayin.

76
00:04:05,249 --> 00:04:08,416
Baqlajonni tempura qilsak, juda mazali boʻladi.

77
00:04:08,439 --> 00:04:11,572
Tempurami? Yoqadi.

78
00:04:11,595 --> 00:04:14,762
Tempura tayyorlaganmisiz?

79
00:04:14,785 --> 00:04:18,260
Yoʻq, tayyorlamaganman.

80
00:04:18,283 --> 00:04:21,620
Keyinroq tayyorlashni oʻrgataman.

81
00:04:21,644 --> 00:04:24,610
Rostdanmi? Iltimos.

82
00:04:24,633 --> 00:04:28,000
Koʻp ovqat pishirib bering, iltimos.

83
00:04:28,023 --> 00:04:30,990
Ha, bugun pishiraman.

84
00:04:31,013 --> 00:04:34,179
Yeb boʻlmasa, menga ayting.

85
00:04:34,202 --> 00:04:37,038
Yeb boʻlmasa deysizmi?

86
00:04:37,062 --> 00:04:40,997
Ha, ovqat tayyorlab olib kelaman.

87
00:04:41,020 --> 00:04:44,954
Rostdanmi? Juda mehribon ekansiz.

88
00:04:44,977 --> 00:04:47,746
Qishloqda bu oddiy hol.

89
00:04:47,769 --> 00:04:49,569
Rahmat.

90
00:04:49,592 --> 00:04:51,559
Juda xursand boʻldim.

91
00:04:51,582 --> 00:04:58,687
Bugungi videodagi mavzularni takrorlash uchun sayt havolasini tavsif va eng yuqori kommentda topishingiz mumkin. *Sayt oldindan ogohlantirmasdan oʻchirilishi mumkin.

92
00:04:58,687 --> 00:05:00,187
3-Sahna: Xodimsiz doʻkonni qanday ishlatish / How to Use an Unmanned Store

93
00:05:00,187 --> 00:05:03,926
Mayk, qayerga ketmoqchisiz?

94
00:05:03,950 --> 00:05:07,283
Doʻkonga borishni xohlayman.

95
00:05:07,306 --> 00:05:12,043
A, bu yaqinlarda doʻkon yoʻq.

96
00:05:12,066 --> 00:05:15,523
Yoʻqmi?

97
00:05:15,547 --> 00:05:20,835
Eng yaqin doʻkon mashinada 30 daqiqa uzoqlikda.

98
00:05:20,858 --> 00:05:24,229
Mashinada 30 daqiqami?

99
00:05:24,253 --> 00:05:27,820
Mening mashinam yoʻq.

100
00:05:27,843 --> 00:05:30,916
Bu qiyin ekan.

101
00:05:30,939 --> 00:05:34,318
Qayerda xarid qilasiz?

102
00:05:34,342 --> 00:05:37,996
Bu yerda xodimsiz doʻkon bor.

103
00:05:38,020 --> 00:05:40,353
Xodimsiz doʻkon.

104
00:05:40,376 --> 00:05:42,709
Bu nima?

105
00:05:42,732 --> 00:05:46,616
Bu odamsiz kichik doʻkon.

106
00:05:46,640 --> 00:05:49,376
Hech kim yoʻqmi?

107
00:05:49,399 --> 00:05:51,933
Qanday qilib sotib olamiz?

108
00:05:51,956 --> 00:05:56,689
Sabzavotlarni tanlang va qutiga pul tashlang.

109
00:05:56,712 --> 00:05:59,945
Qutiga pul tashlaymizmi?

110
00:05:59,968 --> 00:06:02,435
Oʻgʻirlab ketishmaydimi?

111
00:06:02,458 --> 00:06:05,269
Hech kim oʻgʻirlamaydi.

112
00:06:05,293 --> 00:06:07,365
Xavotir olmang.

113
00:06:07,388 --> 00:06:09,602
Ajoyib ekan!

114
00:06:09,625 --> 00:06:12,560
Amerikada bunday narsa yoʻq.

115
00:06:12,584 --> 00:06:16,317
Arzon va mazali sabzavotlar bor.

116
00:06:16,340 --> 00:06:18,474
Qancha turadi?

117
00:06:18,497 --> 00:06:21,897
100 yoki 200 yen.

118
00:06:21,919 --> 00:06:24,558
Juda arzon ekan!

119
00:06:24,581 --> 00:06:29,029
Shuningdek, koʻchma savdo mashinasi ham keladi.

120
00:06:29,052 --> 00:06:31,386
Koʻchma savdo mashinasi deb?

121
00:06:31,409 --> 00:06:35,775
Mashinada koʻp ovqat bor.

122
00:06:35,798 --> 00:06:38,965
Mashina sotuvga keladimi?

123
00:06:38,988 --> 00:06:40,794
Ha.

124
00:06:40,818 --> 00:06:44,074
Seshanba va juma kunlari keladi.

125
00:06:44,097 --> 00:06:47,591
Non va goʻsht ham bormi?

126
00:06:47,615 --> 00:06:51,085
Baliq ham, dufu ham bor.

127
00:06:51,108 --> 00:06:54,121
Shirinliklar va ichimliklar ham bormi?

128
00:06:54,144 --> 00:06:55,678
Ha.

129
00:06:55,701 --> 00:06:58,506
Mevalar ham bor.

130
00:06:58,530 --> 00:07:01,663
Bu juda qulay ekan!

131
00:07:01,686 --> 00:07:05,253
Bugun tushdan keyin soat 2 da keladi.

132
00:07:05,276 --> 00:07:07,609
Ovoz chiqadimi?

133
00:07:07,632 --> 00:07:09,205
Ha.

134
00:07:09,229 --> 00:07:13,062
Musiqa eshitilsa, tashqariga chiqing.

135
00:07:13,085 --> 00:07:15,118
Tushunarli.

136
00:07:15,141 --> 00:07:17,512
Musiqani kutaman.

137
00:07:17,536 --> 00:07:20,469
Birga xarid qilishga boring.

138
00:07:20,492 --> 00:07:22,189
Ha.

139
00:07:22,213 --> 00:07:24,016
Iltimos.

140
00:07:24,040 --> 00:07:25,540
4-Sahna: Qishloq va shahardagi avtobuslar / Qishloq va shahar avtobuslarining chastotasi

141
00:07:25,540 --> 00:07:30,073
Mayk, avtobus bekatida nima qilyapsiz?

142
00:07:30,096 --> 00:07:33,429
Avtobusni kutyapman.

143
00:07:33,452 --> 00:07:37,185
Avtobus endi ketdi-ku!

144
00:07:37,208 --> 00:07:40,542
Rostdanmi?!

145
00:07:40,565 --> 00:07:45,413
Ha. Keyingi avtobus bir soatdan keyin keladi.

146
00:07:45,436 --> 00:07:48,170
Bir soatdan keyin?

147
00:07:48,193 --> 00:07:51,252
Bir soatda bitta avtobus keladimi?

148
00:07:51,276 --> 00:07:56,123
Ha. Qishloqdagi avtobuslar kam boʻladi.

149
00:07:56,146 --> 00:08:01,631
Nyu-Yorkdagi avtobuslar har besh daqiqada keladi.

150
00:08:01,654 --> 00:08:03,588
Besh daqiqadami?

151
00:08:03,611 --> 00:08:06,377
Bu juda tez ekan!

152
00:08:06,400 --> 00:08:09,367
Bir soat kutish kerakmi?

153
00:08:09,390 --> 00:08:11,524
Muammo boʻldi-ku.

154
00:08:11,548 --> 00:08:14,121
Qayerga ketmoqchisiz?

155
00:08:14,144 --> 00:08:17,014
Poyezd stansiyasiga borishni xohlayman.

156
00:08:17,038 --> 00:08:20,213
Birov bilan stansiyada uchrashasizmi?

157
00:08:20,236 --> 00:08:25,296
Yo'q. Poyezdda katta shaharga boraman.

158
00:08:25,319 --> 00:08:28,007
Xarid qilasizmi?

159
00:08:28,030 --> 00:08:31,997
Ha. Kiyim va kitob xarid qilish uchun boraman.

160
00:08:32,020 --> 00:08:34,820
Jadvalga qaradingizmi?

161
00:08:34,842 --> 00:08:39,409
Ha, lekin yaxshi tushunmadim.

162
00:08:39,433 --> 00:08:42,799
Qanday qarashni o'rgataman.

163
00:08:42,822 --> 00:08:44,598
Iltimos.

164
00:08:44,622 --> 00:08:47,688
Bu ish kunlari uchun vaqt.

165
00:08:47,711 --> 00:08:49,478
Ha.

166
00:08:49,501 --> 00:08:52,741
Bu shanba kunlari uchun vaqt.

167
00:08:52,765 --> 00:08:56,398
Yakshanba qayerda?

168
00:08:56,421 --> 00:09:00,188
Yakshanba kunlari avtobus yo'q.

169
00:09:00,211 --> 00:09:05,260
Vay, yakshanba kunlari avtobus yo'qmi?

170
00:09:05,283 --> 00:09:09,016
Ha. Dam olish kuni.

171
00:09:09,039 --> 00:09:11,850
Bu qiyin ekan.

172
00:09:11,873 --> 00:09:14,772
Velosipeddan foydalanasizmi?

173
00:09:14,796 --> 00:09:17,563
Velosipedim bor.

174
00:09:17,586 --> 00:09:21,386
Stansiyagacha velosipedda 20 daqiqa.

175
00:09:21,409 --> 00:09:25,476
Avtobusni kutishdan tezroq ekan.

176
00:09:25,499 --> 00:09:29,343
Bugun mening mashinamda olib ketaymi?

177
00:09:29,367 --> 00:09:31,300
Rostdanmi?

178
00:09:31,323 --> 00:09:33,690
Yordam berdingiz.

179
00:09:33,713 --> 00:09:37,532
Mashinada 10 daqiqada boramiz.

180
00:09:37,555 --> 00:09:39,161
Rahmat.

181
00:09:39,185 --> 00:09:41,520
Olib keting iltimos.

182
00:09:41,544 --> 00:09:43,044
5-SAHNA: Hasharotlarga qarshi kurashish / Hasharotlarga qanday munosabatda bo‘lish kerak

183
00:09:43,044 --> 00:09:46,329
Mayk-san, nima bo'ldi?

184
00:09:46,352 --> 00:09:49,223
Y-o-ordam bering!

185
00:09:49,246 --> 00:09:51,328
Nima bo'ldi?

186
00:09:51,351 --> 00:09:55,442
Xonada katta hasharot bor.

187
00:09:55,466 --> 00:09:57,948
Katta hasharotmi?

188
00:09:57,971 --> 00:10:00,138
Qarab kelaylik.

189
00:10:00,161 --> 00:10:02,100
Ana u yerda.

190
00:10:02,124 --> 00:10:03,757
Devorda turibdi.

191
00:10:03,780 --> 00:10:06,914
A, qirqoyoq ekan.

192
00:10:06,937 --> 00:10:08,908
Qirqoyoq?

193
00:10:08,931 --> 00:10:11,105
Zaxari bormi?

194
00:10:11,128 --> 00:10:13,613
Biroz bor.

195
00:10:13,636 --> 00:10:15,810
Tegmang.

196
00:10:15,834 --> 00:10:17,726
Qo'rqaman.

197
00:10:17,750 --> 00:10:19,516
Nima qilamiz?

198
00:10:19,539 --> 00:10:22,198
Bu spreydan foydalanamiz.

199
00:10:22,221 --> 00:10:25,255
Pshsh deydigan spreymi?

200
00:10:25,278 --> 00:10:26,717
Ha.

201
00:10:26,741 --> 00:10:29,038
Shu bilan yo'qoladi.

202
00:10:29,061 --> 00:10:30,948
Rahmat.

203
00:10:30,972 --> 00:10:33,027
Yordam berdingiz.

204
00:10:33,050 --> 00:10:36,319
Amerikadagi uylarda yo'qmi?

205
00:10:36,343 --> 00:10:39,756
Nyu-Yorkdagi kvartiralarda yo'q edi.

206
00:10:39,780 --> 00:10:43,813
Eski uylar yog'och va tuproqdan qilingan.

207
00:10:43,836 --> 00:10:46,691
Hasharotlar oson kiradi, shundaymi?

208
00:10:46,715 --> 00:10:48,548
Shunday.

209
00:10:48,571 --> 00:10:51,204
Tog' yaqin bo'lgani uchun.

210
00:10:51,227 --> 00:10:53,761
Boshqa hasharotlar ham chiqadimi?

211
00:10:53,784 --> 00:10:57,680
Yozda qandalalar va o'rgimchaklar chiqadi.

212
00:10:57,703 --> 00:11:00,797
Qandala – bu sassiq hasharotmi?

213
00:11:00,821 --> 00:11:02,555
Ha.

214
00:11:02,578 --> 00:11:05,476
Tegsa, juda sassiq boʻladi.

215
00:11:05,499 --> 00:11:07,866
Uni tashqariga qanday chiqarish mumkin?

216
00:11:07,889 --> 00:11:12,387
Qogʻoz ustiga qoʻyib, sekin tashqariga chiqaring.

217
00:11:12,410 --> 00:11:14,743
Urgʻilab boʻlmaydimi?

218
00:11:14,766 --> 00:11:16,200
Ha.

219
00:11:16,223 --> 00:11:19,223
Urgʻilasangiz, juda sassiq boʻladi.

220
00:11:19,246 --> 00:11:20,862
Tushunarli.

221
00:11:20,885 --> 00:11:22,928
Eslab qolaman.

222
00:11:22,951 --> 00:11:25,569
Derazani yoping.

223
00:11:25,593 --> 00:11:27,059
Ha.

224
00:11:27,082 --> 00:11:29,649
Moskit toʻrini ham yaxshi yoping.

225
00:11:29,672 --> 00:11:32,739
Hasharotlarga qarshi dori sotib olaylik.

226
00:11:32,762 --> 00:11:34,795
Qayerdan sotib olish mumkin?

227
00:11:34,818 --> 00:11:37,390
Dorixonalarda sotiladi.

228
00:11:37,414 --> 00:11:39,814
Bugun borib sotib olaman.

229
00:11:39,837 --> 00:11:41,337
6-Sahna: Qishloq tozalash tadbiri / Qishloqni tozalash faoliyati

230
00:11:41,337 --> 00:11:45,937
Mayk, ertaga ertalab bandmisiz?

231
00:11:45,960 --> 00:11:49,575
Yoʻq, boʻshman.

232
00:11:49,598 --> 00:11:51,211
Nima uchun?

233
00:11:51,235 --> 00:11:55,814
Ertaga qishloq tozalash kuni.

234
00:11:55,837 --> 00:11:58,070
Tozalash tadbiri?

235
00:11:58,093 --> 00:12:00,266
Bu nima?

236
00:12:00,289 --> 00:12:04,575
Hammamiz yoʻldagi axlatlarni yigʻamiz.

237
00:12:04,598 --> 00:12:06,732
Shundaymi?

238
00:12:06,755 --> 00:12:09,634
Soat nechada boshlanadi?

239
00:12:09,657 --> 00:12:12,457
Ertalab soat 7 da.

240
00:12:12,481 --> 00:12:15,373
Ertalab soat 7 da?

241
00:12:15,397 --> 00:12:17,964
Juda erta ekan.

242
00:12:17,987 --> 00:12:22,793
Ha, issiq boʻlishidan oldin qilamiz.

243
00:12:22,817 --> 00:12:25,217
Qayerda yigʻilamiz?

244
00:12:25,240 --> 00:12:28,773
Bogʻ oldida yigʻilamiz.

245
00:12:28,796 --> 00:12:31,363
Nima olib kelish kerak?

246
00:12:31,386 --> 00:12:35,605
Ish qoʻlqopi va axlat qoplarini olib keling.

247
00:12:35,628 --> 00:12:37,228
Gunte?

248
00:12:37,251 --> 00:12:40,051
Ish qoʻlqopi nima?

249
00:12:40,074 --> 00:12:43,674
Oq mato qoʻlqoplar.

250
00:12:43,697 --> 00:12:45,914
Tushunarli.

251
00:12:45,937 --> 00:12:48,510
Utlarni ham oʻradikmi?

252
00:12:48,534 --> 00:12:50,148
Ha.

253
00:12:50,171 --> 00:12:53,138
Daryo boʻyidagi oʻtlarni oʻramiz.

254
00:12:53,161 --> 00:12:56,161
Asboblar bormi?

255
00:12:56,184 --> 00:12:59,665
Katta qaychi ijaraga beramiz.

256
00:12:59,689 --> 00:13:01,555
Rahmat.

257
00:13:01,578 --> 00:13:05,013
Rezina etik kiyib keling.

258
00:13:05,037 --> 00:13:07,171
Rezina etikmi?

259
00:13:07,194 --> 00:13:09,492
Bor.

260
00:13:09,515 --> 00:13:12,327
Bu yaxshi.

261
00:13:12,350 --> 00:13:15,428
Qishloq aholisi hammasi keladimi?

262
00:13:15,452 --> 00:13:17,222
Ha.

263
00:13:17,245 --> 00:13:20,184
20 kishi atrofida yigʻilamiz.

264
00:13:20,207 --> 00:13:24,207
Amerikada bunday tadbirlar boʻlmagan.

265
00:13:24,230 --> 00:13:27,697
Hammamiz qishloqni tozalaymiz.

266
00:13:27,720 --> 00:13:31,732
Ajoyib odat ekan.

267
00:13:31,756 --> 00:13:35,164
Tozalashdan keyin choy ichamiz.

268
00:13:35,187 --> 00:13:36,874
Choymi?

269
00:13:36,898 --> 00:13:39,031
Qiziqarli koʻrinadi.

270
00:13:39,054 --> 00:13:42,546
Qishloq ahli bilan doʻstlashishingiz mumkin.

271
00:13:42,570 --> 00:13:45,255
Bu yaxshi gap.

272
00:13:45,278 --> 00:13:47,644
Kutishga arziydi.

273
00:13:47,667 --> 00:13:51,701
Ertaga ertalab sizni chaqirib kelaman.

274
00:13:51,724 --> 00:13:54,198
Iltimos, marhamat.

275
00:13:54,221 --> 00:13:55,721
7-Sahna: Choy va tuzlamalar / Choy va Turshaklar

276
00:13:55,721 --> 00:13:59,088
Mayk, salom.

277
00:13:59,111 --> 00:14:01,477
Kira olsam boʻladi mi?

278
00:14:01,500 --> 00:14:06,434
Ha, iltimos, kiring.

279
00:14:06,457 --> 00:14:09,354
Turshak tayyorladim.

280
00:14:09,377 --> 00:14:12,144
Olib keldim.

281
00:14:12,167 --> 00:14:14,734
Turshakmi?

282
00:14:14,757 --> 00:14:16,523
Rahmat.

283
00:14:16,546 --> 00:14:19,788
Choy ichib, turshak yeyishni boshlaymiz.

284
00:14:19,812 --> 00:14:21,746
Yaxshi fikr.

285
00:14:21,769 --> 00:14:24,405
Choy quyaman.

286
00:14:24,428 --> 00:14:27,518
Issiq choy yaxshi boʻladi mi?

287
00:14:27,541 --> 00:14:31,708
Ha, iliq yashil choy yaxshi koʻraman.

288
00:14:31,731 --> 00:14:35,764
Bu turpning turshagʻi.

289
00:14:35,787 --> 00:14:39,636
Oq va chiroyli turshak ekan.

290
00:14:39,659 --> 00:14:44,096
Biroz nordon, lekin mazali.

291
00:14:44,120 --> 00:14:46,214
Yeyishni boshlaymiz.

292
00:14:46,238 --> 00:14:50,049
Mmm, mazali ekan.

293
00:14:50,072 --> 00:14:52,691
Yaxshi boʻldi.

294
00:14:52,714 --> 00:14:55,447
Tamingizga mos keldi mi?

295
00:14:55,470 --> 00:14:59,737
Ha, qarsillab, mazali ekan.

296
00:14:59,760 --> 00:15:03,001
Oʻzim tayyorladim.

297
00:15:03,025 --> 00:15:05,714
Oʻzingiz qila olasizmi?

298
00:15:05,738 --> 00:15:08,071
Ajoyib!

299
00:15:08,094 --> 00:15:12,743
Qishloq buvilari hammasi qila oladi.

300
00:15:12,766 --> 00:15:17,166
Amerikada pikllar yeyishadi.

301
00:15:17,189 --> 00:15:19,563
Pikllar deb?

302
00:15:19,587 --> 00:15:22,454
Turshak bilan bir xil, shundaymi?

303
00:15:22,477 --> 00:15:26,877
Ha, lekin taʼmi biroz farq qiladi.

304
00:15:26,900 --> 00:15:31,105
Yapon soya sousi va tuzidan foydalanamiz.

305
00:15:31,128 --> 00:15:35,584
Tushunarli, sogʻliqqa foydali koʻrinadi.

306
00:15:35,607 --> 00:15:40,253
Ha, sogʻliq uchun juda yaxshi.

307
00:15:40,276 --> 00:15:43,152
Har kuni yeyapsizmi?

308
00:15:43,176 --> 00:15:48,709
Ha, nonushta paytida albatta yeyaman.

309
00:15:48,732 --> 00:15:52,369
Tayyorlash usulini oʻrgatsangiz boʻladi mi?

310
00:15:52,393 --> 00:15:56,996
Albatta, juda oson.

311
00:15:57,020 --> 00:16:00,253
Qachon oʻrgatasiz?

312
00:16:00,276 --> 00:16:03,876
Kelgusi hafta birga qilamiz.

313
00:16:03,899 --> 00:16:06,699
Juda xursand boʻldim.

314
00:16:06,722 --> 00:16:09,289
Kutgandayman.

315
00:16:09,312 --> 00:16:13,318
Turpni daladan olib qoʻyaman.

316
00:16:13,342 --> 00:16:17,508
Daladanmi? Ajoyib!

317
00:16:17,531 --> 00:16:20,398
Koʻproq choy ichasizmi?

318
00:16:20,421 --> 00:16:24,038
Ha, ichaman.

319
00:16:24,061 --> 00:16:25,561
8-Sahna: Festivalga tayyorgarlik / Festivalga Tayyorgarlik

320
00:16:25,561 --> 00:16:29,928
Mayk, tez orada kuz keladi.

321
00:16:29,951 --> 00:16:34,518
Ha, shamol salqinlashdi.

322
00:16:34,541 --> 00:16:39,474
Kelgusi yakshanba kuni ziyoratgohda festival boʻladi.

323
00:16:39,497 --> 00:16:41,830
Festivalmi?

324
00:16:41,853 --> 00:16:44,261
Qiziqarli koʻrinadi.

325
00:16:44,285 --> 00:16:47,652
Shanba kuni tayyorgarlik koʻramiz.

326
00:16:47,675 --> 00:16:50,408
Yordam berishingiz mumkinmi?

327
00:16:50,431 --> 00:16:52,570
Albatta.

328
00:16:52,593 --> 00:16:55,332
Nimaga yordam beray?

329
00:16:55,356 --> 00:16:58,189
Chiroqlarni bezaymiz.

330
00:16:58,212 --> 00:17:00,214
Chiroqlar?

331
00:17:00,238 --> 00:17:03,238
Chiroqlar nima?

332
00:17:03,261 --> 00:17:07,028
Qogʻozdan yasalgan chiroq.

333
00:17:07,051 --> 00:17:09,509
Qizil va dumaloq.

334
00:17:09,533 --> 00:17:11,909
Aa, bilaman.

335
00:17:11,932 --> 00:17:14,066
Chiroyli ekan.

336
00:17:14,089 --> 00:17:18,302
Keyin, mikoshi (ma'buda palankasi)ni yuvamiz.

337
00:17:18,325 --> 00:17:20,492
Mikoshi?

338
00:17:20,515 --> 00:17:24,759
Ha, xudoning transporti.

339
00:17:24,783 --> 00:17:27,787
Mikoshi ogʻirmi?

340
00:17:27,810 --> 00:17:30,748
Juda ogʻir.

341
00:17:30,772 --> 00:17:33,449
Barchamiz birga koʻtaramiz.

342
00:17:33,473 --> 00:17:37,006
Oʻsha kuni men ham koʻtarishga yordam berishim mumkinmi?

343
00:17:37,029 --> 00:17:41,729
Ha, Mayk ham biz bilan birga koʻtaring.

344
00:17:41,752 --> 00:17:44,885
Vaa, sinab koʻrmoqchiman!

345
00:17:44,908 --> 00:17:47,912
Maxsus kiyim kiyamiz.

346
00:17:47,936 --> 00:17:50,336
Happi (yaponcha bayram kiyimi).

347
00:17:50,359 --> 00:17:52,293
Happi?

348
00:17:52,316 --> 00:17:54,550
Juda zoʻr koʻrinadi!

349
00:17:54,573 --> 00:17:58,573
Siz uchun koʻk happi tayyorlab qoʻyaman.

350
00:17:58,596 --> 00:18:00,529
Rahmat.

351
00:18:00,552 --> 00:18:02,796
Kutishga arziydi.

352
00:18:02,820 --> 00:18:06,257
Amerikada ham bayramlar bormi?

353
00:18:06,280 --> 00:18:08,680
Paradlar boʻladi.

354
00:18:08,703 --> 00:18:12,108
Lekin mikoshi yoʻq.

355
00:18:12,132 --> 00:18:16,665
Yaponiyaning bayramlari juda gavjum boʻladi.

356
00:18:16,688 --> 00:18:18,728
Doʻkonlar ham chiqadimi?

357
00:18:18,752 --> 00:18:23,368
Ha. Tako-yaki va yakisoba doʻkonlari boʻladi.

358
00:18:23,391 --> 00:18:25,470
Juda mazali koʻrinadi.

359
00:18:25,493 --> 00:18:27,942
Yeyishni xohlardim.

360
00:18:27,965 --> 00:18:31,264
Tungi paytda otashinlar ham uchiriladi.

361
00:18:31,288 --> 00:18:33,455
Otashinlar?

362
00:18:33,478 --> 00:18:35,811
Ajoyib!

363
00:18:35,834 --> 00:18:39,634
Koʻp suratga oling.

364
00:18:39,657 --> 00:18:42,591
Amerikadagi oilamga koʻrsataman.

365
00:18:42,614 --> 00:18:46,790
Shanba kuni ertalab soat 9 da ziyoratgohga keling.

366
00:18:46,813 --> 00:18:50,246
Ha. Albatta boraman.

367
00:18:50,269 --> 00:18:51,769
Sahna 9: Qishning sovuqligi va oʻtin pechkasi / Qish sovuqi va oʻtin pechlari

368
00:18:51,769 --> 00:18:56,369
Mayk, yaqinda havo sovib ketdi, shundaymi?

369
00:18:56,392 --> 00:19:01,130
Ha, ertalab va kechalari juda sovuq.

370
00:19:01,154 --> 00:19:05,425
Qishloqdagi qish yanada sovuqroq boʻladi.

371
00:19:05,448 --> 00:19:07,887
Qor yogʻadimi?

372
00:19:07,911 --> 00:19:11,006
Ha, koʻp yogʻadi.

373
00:19:11,029 --> 00:19:13,862
Uy ichi ham sovuqmi?

374
00:19:13,886 --> 00:19:18,760
Ha, eski uylarda shamol kiradi.

375
00:19:18,783 --> 00:19:21,116
Shamol kiradimi?

376
00:19:21,139 --> 00:19:23,424
Nima qilish kerak?

377
00:19:23,448 --> 00:19:26,381
Oʻtin pechidan foydalanamiz.

378
00:19:26,404 --> 00:19:28,604
Yogʻoch pechmi?

379
00:19:28,627 --> 00:19:32,194
Yogʻoch yoqadigan pechmi?

380
00:19:32,217 --> 00:19:35,785
Ha, juda issiq boʻladi.

381
00:19:35,809 --> 00:19:38,342
Yogʻochlarni qayerda topish mumkin?

382
00:19:38,365 --> 00:19:41,639
Bogʻda koʻp yogʻoch bor.

383
00:19:41,662 --> 00:19:45,239
Ularni uyga olib kirish kerak, shundaymi?

384
00:19:45,263 --> 00:19:48,530
Ha, har kuni olib kiraman.

385
00:19:48,553 --> 00:19:51,166
Ancha ogʻirdek koʻrinadi.

386
00:19:51,189 --> 00:19:56,163
Ha, lekin yaxshi mashq boʻladi.

387
00:19:56,187 --> 00:20:00,454
Nyu-Yorkdagi uyda markaziy isitish tizimi bor edi.

388
00:20:00,477 --> 00:20:02,736
Bu nima?

389
00:20:02,759 --> 00:20:07,992
Tugmani bos, butun xona iliq boʻladi.

390
00:20:08,015 --> 00:20:10,815
Vay, qanchalik qulay.

391
00:20:10,838 --> 00:20:14,073
Qishloqda jismoniy mehnat koʻp.

392
00:20:14,097 --> 00:20:17,864
Yogʻochlarni ham oʻzingiz chopasizmi?

393
00:20:17,887 --> 00:20:20,853
Ha, boltacha bilan chopaman.

394
00:20:20,876 --> 00:20:24,893
Bolta bilanmi? Biroz qiyin koʻrinadi.

395
00:20:24,916 --> 00:20:28,483
Usulini oʻrgataman, muammo yoʻq.

396
00:20:28,506 --> 00:20:30,977
Harakat qilib koʻraman.

397
00:20:31,000 --> 00:20:33,680
Kotatsu bilan ham tanishishni xohlaysizmi?

398
00:20:33,704 --> 00:20:35,937
Kotatsu deb?

399
00:20:35,960 --> 00:20:37,994
U nima?

400
00:20:38,017 --> 00:20:41,095
Iliq stol.

401
00:20:41,118 --> 00:20:44,956
Kotatsu ichida mandarin yeyish – ajoyib his!

402
00:20:44,980 --> 00:20:47,513
Ha, ajoyib boʻlardi.

403
00:20:47,536 --> 00:20:49,803
Sinab koʻrmoqchiman.

404
00:20:49,826 --> 00:20:53,559
Ertaga siz uchun kotatsu olib kelaman.

405
00:20:53,582 --> 00:20:55,249
Rostdanmi?

406
00:20:55,272 --> 00:20:57,672
Rahmat.

407
00:20:57,695 --> 00:20:59,195
10-SAHNA: Yulduzli osmonning goʻzalligi

408
00:20:59,195 --> 00:21:03,761
Mayk, bugun kechasi osmon chiroyli, shundaymi?

409
00:21:03,784 --> 00:21:06,042
Ha, rostdan ham chiroyli.

410
00:21:06,066 --> 00:21:10,032
Koʻp yulduzlar koʻrinib turibdi.

411
00:21:10,055 --> 00:21:13,222
Qishloqda havo toza boʻladi.

412
00:21:13,245 --> 00:21:17,323
Nyu-Yorkda yulduzlarni koʻra olmadim.

413
00:21:17,347 --> 00:21:19,422
Nega?

414
00:21:19,445 --> 00:21:23,612
Binolarning chiroqlari juda yorugʻ edi.

415
00:21:23,635 --> 00:21:25,402
Tushunarli.

416
00:21:25,425 --> 00:21:29,592
Bu yerda kechalari qorongʻi boʻladi-ku.

417
00:21:29,615 --> 00:21:33,274
Dastlab qorongʻilikdan qoʻrqardim.

418
00:21:33,297 --> 00:21:36,265
Endi-qoʻshimcha?

419
00:21:36,289 --> 00:21:40,165
Endi bu sukunatni yaxshi koʻraman.

420
00:21:40,188 --> 00:21:43,081
Qishloq hayotiga oʻrganib qoldingizmi?

421
00:21:43,105 --> 00:21:44,783
Ha.

422
00:21:44,806 --> 00:21:47,374
Har kuni zavq bagʻishlaydi.

423
00:21:47,398 --> 00:21:50,454
Kunduzgi manzara ham yaxshi boʻlsa kerak.

424
00:21:50,477 --> 00:21:51,965
Ha.

425
00:21:51,989 --> 00:21:55,356
Togʻlarning rangi juda chiroyli.

426
00:21:55,379 --> 00:21:59,779
Bahorda yashil, kuzda qizil rangga kiradi.

427
00:21:59,802 --> 00:22:03,574
Mavsumlarning oʻzgarishini yaqqol koʻrish mumkin.

428
00:22:03,597 --> 00:22:07,964
Daryo suvi ham juda sovuq va toza.

429
00:22:07,987 --> 00:22:10,387
Baliq ham bormi?

430
00:22:10,410 --> 00:22:11,863
Ha.

431
00:22:11,886 --> 00:22:15,854
Kichik baliqlar koʻp suzadi.

432
00:22:15,878 --> 00:22:19,044
Navbatda daryoda baliq ovlashni sinab koʻrmoqchiman.

433
00:22:19,067 --> 00:22:20,834
Yaxshi fikr.

434
00:22:20,857 --> 00:22:23,835
Baliq ovlash asboblarini ijaraga beraman.

435
00:22:23,858 --> 00:22:25,459
Rahmat.

436
00:22:25,483 --> 00:22:29,661
Qoʻshnilar bilan ham yaxshi munosabatda boʻldingiz-ku.

437
00:22:29,685 --> 00:22:33,051
Ha, hammangiz juda mehribon ekansiz.

438
00:22:33,074 --> 00:22:37,120
Mayk san doim tabassum bilan salomlashgani uchun.

439
00:22:37,144 --> 00:22:39,877
Salomlashish juda muhim, shunday emasmi?

440
00:22:39,900 --> 00:22:43,467
Shaharga qaytishni xohlaysizmi?

441
00:22:43,490 --> 00:22:47,580
Yoʻq, umuman xohlamayman.

442
00:22:47,603 --> 00:22:50,570
Buni eshitib, yuragim tinchlandi.

443
00:22:50,593 --> 00:22:53,926
Men bu yerda abadiy yashamoqchiman.

444
00:22:53,949 --> 00:22:58,483
Ertaga togʻ tepasidagi kuzatuv maydonchasiga boring.

445
00:22:58,506 --> 00:23:00,472
Kuzatuv maydonchasi?

446
00:23:00,495 --> 00:23:03,262
Manzara koʻrinadigan joymi?

447
00:23:03,285 --> 00:23:05,018
Ha.

448
00:23:05,041 --> 00:23:07,849
Qishloqning hammasi koʻrinadi.

449
00:23:07,873 --> 00:23:10,007
Borishni xohlayman!

450
00:23:10,030 --> 00:23:12,301
Nima bilan boramiz?

451
00:23:12,324 --> 00:23:14,991
Velosipedda boring.

452
00:23:15,014 --> 00:23:16,780
Yaxshi fikr.

453
00:23:16,803 --> 00:23:19,416
Kutgandayman.